msgid ""
msgstr "Project-Id-Version: Orbit 1.0\nReport-Msgid-Bugs-To: \nPOT-Creation-Date: 2026-10-29 15:37+0800\nPO-Revision-Date: 2026-10-29 20:00+0800\nLast-Translator: junjunlab\nLanguage-Team: zh_CN <LL@li.org>\nLanguage: zh_CN\nMIME-Version: 1.0\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\nPlural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\nGenerated-By: Babel 2.18.0\n"

msgid "Building from source"
msgstr "从源码构建"

msgid "Running it"
msgstr "运行"

msgid "Orbit needs Python 3.10 or newer and PySide6. Everything else is standard library."
msgstr "Orbit 需要 Python 3.10 或更高版本以及 PySide6，其余全部是标准库。"

msgid "Freezing"
msgstr "打包冻结"

msgid "``build/make_exe.py`` wraps PyInstaller and is the single entry point for both platforms."
msgstr "``build/make_exe.py`` 封装了 PyInstaller，是两个平台唯一的入口脚本。"

msgid "``--no-genomes`` skips the ``*.2bit`` files, so the bundle carries annotation only and sequence comes from UCSC. This is what the installers use."
msgstr "``--no-genomes`` 会跳过 ``*.2bit`` 文件，因此包内只带注释，序列从 UCSC 获取。正式安装包就是这样构建的。"

msgid "``--windowed`` builds a GUI executable with no console window."
msgstr "``--windowed`` 生成不带控制台窗口的图形界面程序。"

msgid "Without either flag you get a console build with local sequence — useful for debugging."
msgstr "两个参数都不加时，得到的是带本地序列的控制台版本 — 便于调试。"

msgid "The script handles the platform differences that PyInstaller does not:"
msgstr "脚本处理了 PyInstaller 本身不处理的平台差异："

msgid "Difference"
msgstr "差异点"

msgid "Handling"
msgstr "处理方式"

msgid "``--add-data`` separator"
msgstr "``--add-data`` 的分隔符"

msgid "``;`` on Windows, ``:`` on macOS"
msgstr "Windows 用 ``;``，macOS 用 ``:``"

msgid "Output layout"
msgstr "输出结构"

msgid "``dist/Orbit/`` on Windows, ``dist/Orbit.app`` on macOS"
msgstr "Windows 为 ``dist/Orbit/``，macOS 为 ``dist/Orbit.app``"

msgid "Data location"
msgstr "数据位置"

msgid "``data/`` next to the executable, which is ``Contents/MacOS`` inside the bundle"
msgstr "``data/`` 位于可执行文件旁，在应用包内即 ``Contents/MacOS``"

msgid "Bundle id"
msgstr "包标识"

msgid "``--osx-bundle-identifier`` is passed on macOS only"
msgstr "仅在 macOS 上传入 ``--osx-bundle-identifier``"

msgid "Windows installer"
msgstr "Windows 安装包"

msgid "Requires `Inno Setup 6 <https://jrsoftware.org/isinfo.php>`_."
msgstr "需要 `Inno Setup 6 <https://jrsoftware.org/isinfo.php>`_。"

msgid "Produces ``dist\\installer\\Orbit-1.0.2-Windows-x64-Setup.exe``. The script is a per-user install (``PrivilegesRequired=lowest``), which avoids the UAC prompt and lets the app write to its own data directory."
msgstr "产物是 ``dist\\installer\\Orbit-1.0.2-Windows-x64-Setup.exe``。脚本按当前用户安装（``PrivilegesRequired=lowest``），不弹 UAC，程序也能写自己的数据目录。"

msgid "Inno Setup does not ship a Simplified Chinese language file, so ``installer/ChineseSimplified.isl`` is kept in the repository and referenced by a relative path. Without it the compiler fails with *\"Couldn't open include file\"*."
msgstr "Inno Setup 并不自带简体中文语言文件，因此把 ``installer/ChineseSimplified.isl`` 一并放进仓库，并用相对路径引用。缺少它时编译器会报 *\"Couldn't open include file\"*。"

msgid "macOS disk image"
msgstr "macOS 磁盘映像"

msgid "The script ad-hoc signs the bundle, clears extended attributes, stages the app with an ``/Applications`` symlink, and calls ``hdiutil``. Ad-hoc signing is not optional: on Apple Silicon an unsigned arm64 binary is killed on launch."
msgstr "脚本会对应用包做临时签名、清除扩展属性、把应用和指向 ``/Applications`` 的符号链接摆好，然后调用 ``hdiutil``。临时签名不是可选项：在 Apple Silicon 上，未签名的 arm64 二进制一启动就会被系统杀掉。"

msgid "Shipping without the Gatekeeper warning needs an Apple Developer certificate and a notarization step, neither of which the project has."
msgstr "若想彻底消除 Gatekeeper 提示，需要 Apple 开发者证书和公证流程，本项目两者都不具备。"

msgid "Continuous integration"
msgstr "持续集成"

msgid "``.github/workflows/build.yml`` builds all three packages on every tag."
msgstr "``.github/workflows/build.yml`` 会在每次打 tag 时构建全部三个安装包。"

msgid "Job"
msgstr "任务"

msgid "Runner"
msgstr "运行器"

msgid "Produces"
msgstr "产物"

msgid "Windows-x64"
msgstr "Windows-x64"

msgid "``windows-latest``"
msgstr "``windows-latest``"

msgid "Inno Setup installer"
msgstr "Inno Setup 安装程序"

msgid "macOS-arm64"
msgstr "macOS-arm64"

msgid "``macos-15``"
msgstr "``macos-15``"

msgid "arm64 disk image"
msgstr "arm64 磁盘映像"

msgid "macOS-x64"
msgstr "macOS-x64"

msgid "``macos-15-intel``"
msgstr "``macos-15-intel``"

msgid "Intel disk image"
msgstr "Intel 磁盘映像"

msgid "Publish release"
msgstr "发布 Release"

msgid "``ubuntu-latest``"
msgstr "``ubuntu-latest``"

msgid "Collects all three and attaches them to the release"
msgstr "汇总三个产物并附加到 Release 上"

msgid "The release step is a separate job on purpose. Running it inside the matrix means three jobs publish concurrently, which duplicates the release notes and races on the same assets."
msgstr "发布步骤特意拆成独立任务。若放在矩阵内部，三个任务会同时发布，导致发布说明重复、并互相争抢同一批资产。"

msgid "Runner labels are easy to get wrong. ``macos-15`` is Apple Silicon, ``macos-15-intel`` is Intel, and ``macos-15-arm64`` is not a label at all — a job using it queues forever."
msgstr "运行器标签很容易搞错。``macos-15`` 是 Apple Silicon，``macos-15-intel`` 是 Intel，而 ``macos-15-arm64`` 根本不是标签 — 用它写的任务会永远排队。"

msgid "Releasing"
msgstr "发版"

msgid "The tag push triggers the build and attaches the three packages to a new release. Nothing is published for ordinary pushes to ``main``."
msgstr "推送 tag 会触发构建，并把三个安装包附加到新的 Release 上。普通推送到 ``main`` 不会发布任何东西。"

msgid "Building the documentation"
msgstr "构建文档"

msgid "The English build is the source; Chinese comes from the gettext catalogues in ``docs/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES``."
msgstr "英文构建是源语言；中文来自 ``docs/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES`` 下的 gettext 目录。"

msgid "To refresh the catalogues after editing a page:"
msgstr "修改页面后，刷新目录文件："

msgid "Then translate the new ``msgid`` entries and rebuild with ``-D language=zh_CN``."
msgstr "然后翻译新增的 ``msgid`` 条目，并用 ``-D language=zh_CN`` 重新构建。"
